<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f5f7;font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f4f5f7;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:36px 16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e8eaef;">

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:28px 36px 0;text-align:right;direction:rtl;">
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#f2665e;">FLASHSHOP</p>
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:40px;height:3px;background-color:#f2665e;border-radius:2px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:22px 36px 10px;text-align:right;direction:rtl;">
                            <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:#1f2937;">{{title}}</h1>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:6px 36px 32px;text-align:right;direction:rtl;">
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#4b5563;white-space:pre-line;">{{message}}</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:18px 36px;background-color:#fafbfc;border-top:1px solid #eef0f4;border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;text-align:center;direction:rtl;">
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;">
                                נשלח על ידי <span style="color:#f2665e;font-weight:600;">FlashShop</span>
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

                <p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#b0b5bf;text-align:center;direction:rtl;">
                    קיבלתם מייל זה כי אתם רשומים למועדון הלקוחות שלנו
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
